    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dumbass Survivors is a time survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements.<br>Hell is empty, the devils are here, and there's no place to run or hide. All you can do is survive as long as you can until a giant blue blob inevitably puts an end to your struggles.<br><br><i>The supernatural indie phenomenon that lets you be the bullet hell!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Starting Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab coins as fast as possible, they won't disappear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only get one weapon but it's a strong one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sooner your Dumbass is self-sufficient, the sooner you can go have fun on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Dumbass is different.\u00a0 All of them are woefully incompetent</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dumbass Survivors is a time survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements.<br>Hell is empty, the devils are here, and there's no place to run or hide. All you can do is survive as long as you can until a giant blue blob inevitably puts an end to your struggles.<br><br><i>The supernatural indie phenomenon that lets you be the bullet hell!</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Starting Tips</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab coins as fast as possible, they won't disappear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You only get one weapon but it's a strong one</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sooner your Dumbass is self-sufficient, the sooner you can go have fun on your own</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every Dumbass is different.\u00a0 All of them are woefully incompetent</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Mow down thousands of night creatures and survive until dawn! Dumbass Survivors is a gothic horror casual game with rogue-lite elements, where your choices can allow you to quickly snowball against hundreds of monsters.\u00a0 Except you're stuck babysitting the guy who thinks he's the hero.",
